              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "4:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba Yosefu baravuga, bat’ Ek’ uwo mugamba ntiwodukwira; kand’ Abanyakanani bo mu biyaya, ar’ab’i Beti‐sheyani n’ibisagara bihakūkira, ar’ abo mu kiyaya c’i Yezireli, bose bafise imikogote y’ ivyuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosuwa yishura ab’ umuryango wa Yosefu, ari bo Befurayimu n’Abamanase, ati Mur’ umuryango munini koko, kandi mur’ abahizi: ntimwohabga umugabane umwe gusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
